  "story": {
    "day": 142,
    "title": "Kaya's Busy Day",
    "sentences": [
      "Kaya sat at her school desk. Outside, it was a cloudy and windy morning.",
      "She thought about the fourth test, which was math.",
      "Her friend, Kenji, was absent today.",
      "Kaya tried to think of the correct answer for question six.",
      "She did not forget the important facts.",
      "She spent a minute reviewing her notes.",
      "Even if it started to rain, her plans would not change.",
      "\"Time is almost up!\" her teacher announced.",
      "Kaya quickly finished. She was excited for the evening concert.",
      "She hoped to look for an amusement park trip next month.",
      "Kaya, at her age, felt brave to research cancer.",
      "She dreamed of visiting Alaska, seeing snowy landscapes, not rainy streets."
    ]
  }
}